\leqslant \sqrt[n]{{\int_0^1 \int_0^1 \int_0^1 \frac{x^{n-1}(1-x)^ny^{n-1}(1-y)^nz^n(1-z)^n}{[1-(1-xy)][1-z]^{n}}\,dx\,dy\,dz}}
